        "text": "I have not deleted it. That's the whole confession,\nif you want one — three years, and I still can't\npress the button that would make your voice\nstop existing anywhere I have access to.\n\nI don't listen to it. I want to be clear about that.\nI just like knowing it's there, the way you like knowing\na door is locked without needing to check it\nevery single night before you sleep — except\nI check this one. Not often. Just enough\nto remember the specific, unremarkable thing\nyou called to say, some Tuesday, about nothing,\nabout picking up milk, your voice so ordinary\nI didn't think to hold onto it on purpose\nuntil holding onto it was all I had left to do."
