        "title": "Six Months",
        "intro": "The following is an original poem in three numbered sections.",
        "text": "I.\nThe doctor said six months. We did not believe him.\nWe had every reason not to. He had been wrong before.\n\nII.\nThe doctor said six months, and six months came,\nand somehow, impossibly, so did six more after that.\n\nIII.\nThe doctor said six months, four years ago now.\nWe stopped counting somewhere around year two,\nnot from disbelief anymore, just from something\ncloser to gratitude outrunning the need to keep score."
