            "Locate the volta precisely at 'until the last year, when arthritis took the fine work first' — marking the shift from the poem's established catalog of unremarked, ongoing labor to its abrupt, specific loss, the word 'until' functioning as the clear structural signal this unit's Section 8.1 identifies.",
